  "nutritionAboutWhatTitle": "Part of your training",
  "nutritionAboutWhat": "A simple way to log meals, water, protein and supplements right next to your workouts. GymMane is a gym app first: Nutrition is here so you can keep everything in one place, not to replace a dedicated diet app.",
  "nutritionAboutScanTitle": "No scanning, ever",
  "nutritionAboutScan": "Scanning a barcode and having every detail filled in for you would be handy. But it needs the internet and a huge online food database, and what you eat ends up on someone else's servers. That data shows when you eat, what you eat and how you look after your body, and it can be used for advertising or passed on to big companies. That's why there's no scanner, and there won't be one.",
